# JVM crash dumps. The Robot tests abort under load - a SIGABRT, documented in the release notes as known
# flakiness - and each one leaves a 1,480-line crash log at the repository root. Two of them were COMMITTED before
# this line existed, which is how a release repository ends up carrying its own crash reports.
hs_err_pid*.log
replay_pid*.log
